WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.513 --> 00:00:15.802
"Oh thought Wukong.

2
00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:17.884
"Yellow Brows is coming!"

3
00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:22.707
The monkey jumped back to his feet and ran fast out of the monastery.

4
00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:26.109
When he got outside, everyone was waiting for him.

5
00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:28.831
"Where are the bags?"

6
00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:31.256
asked Wujing.

7
00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:32.837
monkey looked at his empty hands.

8
00:00:33.717 --> 00:00:34.817
He slapped his forehead.

9
00:00:35.157 --> 00:00:36.478
"I must have dropped them."

10
00:00:37.478 --> 00:00:40.239
He heard footsteps approaching from inside the monastery.

11
00:00:40.259 --> 00:00:44.000
"We can't worry about the bags now," whispered Wukong.

12
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:45.921
Brows is coming.

13
00:00:46.581 --> 00:00:48.101
We have to go—quickly!"

14
00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:53.223
He helped the Tang Monk up onto the horse.

15
00:00:54.663 --> 00:00:56.044
The group hurried down the road.

16
00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.221
"Run faster, Bajie!"

17
00:01:04.441 --> 00:01:05.242
hissed Wujing.

18
00:01:06.843 --> 00:01:08.724
Bajie breathed heavily.

19
00:01:08.744 --> 00:01:13.988
"I don't like running!"

20
00:01:15.388 --> 00:01:18.331
They hadn't gotten far before Yellow Brows flew over them.

21
00:01:18.351 --> 00:01:22.033
"You can't escape from me!"

22
00:01:22.353 --> 00:01:23.174
shouted the demon.

23
00:01:23.194 --> 00:01:25.976
"And you will not be going to the West.

24
00:01:27.137 --> 00:01:31.780
I am a true Buddhist, and I will be the one to get the True Scriptures!"

25
00:01:33.932 --> 00:01:37.174
Wukong, Bajie, and Wujing pulled out their weapons.

26
00:01:38.195 --> 00:01:40.377
The Gold Dragon bared its claws.

27
00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:46.561
Brows scoffed.

28
00:01:46.841 --> 00:01:49.163
"Do you really think you can fight me?"

29
00:01:50.203 --> 00:01:52.925
He reached into his robe and pulled out the cloth.

30
00:01:54.466 --> 00:01:56.308
Bajie lowered his rake and laughed.

31
00:01:58.309 --> 00:01:59.510
have powerful weapons.

32
00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.744
And all you have is a piece of cloth!"

33
00:02:03.844 --> 00:02:06.545
"That's not an ordinary cloth," warned the dragon.

34
00:02:07.686 --> 00:02:10.007
Yellow Brows threw the cloth toward the group.

35
00:02:10.027 --> 00:02:13.348
"Look out!"

36
00:02:13.568 --> 00:02:14.409
cried Wukong.

37
00:02:15.289 --> 00:02:19.571
The monkey leaped up to the sky just before the cloth wrapped around his companions.

38
00:02:20.451 --> 00:02:23.192
Quickly the demon grabbed the cloth, with the group in it.

39
00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:27.494
He ran back into his monastery and slammed the door shut.

40
00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.156
sat down on a cloud to think.

41
00:02:32.628 --> 00:02:34.530
How could he rescue his companions?

42
00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.773
"I can't ask the Jade Emperor for help," thought Wukong.

43
00:02:38.793 --> 00:02:42.776
"He already sent the Gold Dragon, who was just captured again.

44
00:02:43.937 --> 00:02:45.659
Maybe I can ask Guanyin for help."

45
00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:50.562
As Wukong was wondering what to do, two spirits approached him.

46
00:02:51.824 --> 00:02:54.045
One was a turtle, and the other was a serpent.

47
00:02:55.266 --> 00:02:58.349
The two spirits each carried a sword and a shield.

48
00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.152
from Wudang Mountain," said the turtle.

49
00:03:03.484 --> 00:03:04.865
"We've come to help you."

50
00:03:06.226 --> 00:03:07.127
The serpent nodded.

51
00:03:07.147 --> 00:03:12.010
"We heard the Tang Monk was captured by a demon called Yellow Brows."

52
00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:15.673
"Thank you for coming," said Wukong.

53
00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:18.695
He quickly told them what had happened.

54
00:03:18.715 --> 00:03:23.078
"Let's go to the monastery now," said the turtle.

55
00:03:23.098 --> 00:03:26.681
"Yellow Brows won't be able to fight all three of us."

56
00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:30.924
"We are much too powerful for him," added the serpent.

57
00:03:31.808 --> 00:03:34.669
Wukong led the two spirits down to the monastery.

58
00:03:34.689 --> 00:03:40.732
"Just be careful of his cloth," warned the monkey.

59
00:03:40.752 --> 00:03:43.413
"He'll try to capture us with it."

60
00:03:44.953 --> 00:03:47.014
Wukong banged on the monastery door.

61
00:03:47.034 --> 00:03:50.936
"Release my friends right now, Yellow Brows!

62
00:03:52.116 --> 00:03:54.657
If you don't, I'll knock down your monastery!

63
00:03:55.778 --> 00:03:58.139
Then I'll smash your entire mountain!"

64
00:03:59.599 --> 00:04:00.620
door flew open.

65
00:04:01.632 --> 00:04:04.194
Yellow Brows stepped out and threw the cloth.

66
00:04:06.556 --> 00:04:07.237
"Look out!"

67
00:04:07.417 --> 00:04:08.258
cried Wukong.

68
00:04:08.858 --> 00:04:12.661
The monkey jumped out of the way, but the turtle and serpent weren't fast enough.

69
00:04:13.542 --> 00:04:15.043
The cloth wrapped around them.

70
00:04:17.646 --> 00:04:21.629
Laughing, the demon grabbed the bundle and went back into the monastery.

71
00:04:23.691 --> 00:04:25.172
flew back up into the sky.

72
00:04:26.213 --> 00:04:30.200
He sat on a cloud and moaned.

73
00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:31.501
"Now what will I do?"

74
00:04:32.521 --> 00:04:34.662
He was still thinking when he heard a voice.

75
00:04:34.682 --> 00:04:36.322
"Hello, Wukong!"

76
00:04:37.742 --> 00:04:41.264
Wukong looked toward the voice and saw a man with a big belly.

77
00:04:41.984 --> 00:04:43.204
The man was smiling.

78
00:04:43.224 --> 00:04:45.125
"Do you know who I am?"

79
00:04:45.525 --> 00:04:46.125
asked the man.

80
00:04:47.546 --> 00:04:50.086
smiled. "You're the buddha Maitreya."

81
00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:52.787
"Yes," said Maitreya.

82
00:04:52.807 --> 00:04:54.408
"And I've come to help you."
